    "final_answer": "I have enough information to provide the answer. Let me summarize my findings:\n\n## Summary\n\n**Store Found: Target** (a large department store / 百货商场)\n\n**Location:** 30 Bellis Fair Pkwy, Bellingham, WA 98226, USA (Washington state)\n\n**Description:** Target is a retail chain store that sells household items, clothing, electronic products, and more, including limited edition designer series. Target is well-known for carrying a wide selection of **kids' products** (such as its popular Cat & Jack children's clothing line and toys) and **maternity products** (such as the Liz Lange maternity line and baby items).\n\n**Parking Lot: ✅ YES, Target has a parking lot**\n- 附设停车位 (On-site parking)\n- 免费停车场 (Free parking lot)\n- 收费停车场 (Paid parking lot)\n- The store is also wheelchair accessible\n\n**Other notable Target in Washington DC area:**\n- Target at 3100 14th St NW Ste 201, Washington, DC — rating 3.7 (1,173 reviews)\n\n## Final Answer\n\nI located **Target** as a large store in Washington that sells both **kids' and maternity products** (along with clothing, home goods, and other items). **Yes, it has a parking lot** — specifically offering on-site parking, a free parking lot, and a paid parking lot, with wheelchair-accessible facilities.",
